Neon Lounge
===========

This application includes third-party components. The notices below are
kept with the source tree and in the release credits (Settings screen).

YouTube extractor (src/youtube.c, src/yt_net.h fetchHttp shape)
---------------------------------------------------------------
Portions of src/youtube.c are a port of the YouTube extractor from
TEE Vanced PS3 by TheErsysEnding (github.com/TheErsysEnding/TEE-Vanced-PS3),
which is part of the ps3-dev / Yo! Player tree by Mohammed Asif ("mohasi",
github.com/mohasi/ps3-dev). The string helpers inlined in src/youtube.c
(strCopy, urlDecode, toLowerChar) are likewise from that tree's
string-utilities.h, and the fetchHttp/fetchHttpCapturing signatures in
src/yt_net.h follow its http.h.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license is
in third_party/youtube/LICENSE.

Changes made for Neon Lounge (the port, src/youtube.c as shipped here):
- Transport retargeted: upstream's cellHttp/BearSSL backends are replaced
  by Neon Lounge's own libcurl + mbedTLS stack (src/yt_net.c), reusing the
  update checker's CA bundle and HTTPS-only policy.
- The signed-in account feeds, channel pages and live pages are not
  ported (anonymous use only); the content region is fixed to "US";
  subtitle languages are all treated as displayable (captions are parsed
  but not shown in this version).
- The visitor-session cache writes atomically (temp file + rename).
- App services (settings, account, channel avatars, quiet-thread logging)
  are replaced by small local shims at the top of the file.

YouTube playback: fMP4 demuxer and ranged video source
------------------------------------------------------
The fragmented-MP4 demuxer (src/demux-mp4.c, src/mp4.c, src/h264.c and
the shared access-unit types in src/demux-types.h), the Annex-B AU
builder in src/yt_demux.c, and the ranged video source design
(src/video-source.c: query-string byte ranges for googlevideo, a
prefetch window ahead of the reader) are ported from the ps3-dev /
Yo! Player tree by Mohammed Asif ("mohasi", github.com/mohasi/ps3-dev),
also via TEE Vanced PS3 by TheErsysEnding. The ADTS header layout in
src/yt_adts.c matches that tree's buildAdtsHeader, and the
audio-master sync design in src/yt_sync.c follows its video player.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (copy in
third_party/youtube/LICENSE).

Changes made for Neon Lounge: the transport is Neon Lounge's own
libcurl + mbedTLS stack (not upstream's BearSSL/cellHttp), ranged
reads follow PLAN.md's window policy, a spent stream address is
recovered by re-running the extractor and resuming at the parse
position, and decoding/presentation run through Neon Lounge's own
player (src/yt_player.c).

